<view class="page"><text class="title">结算预览</text><text class="hint">以下建议已尽量减少转账次数。</text><view wx:if="{{transfers.length}}" wx:for="{{transfers}}" wx:key="from_participant_id" class="transfer"><text>{{item.from_participant_id}} → {{item.to_participant_id}}</text><text>{{item.amount.amount}} {{item.amount.currency}}</text></view><view wx:else class="empty">暂无需要转账的余额</view><button class="primary" bindtap="publish">发布结算版本</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="share">创建分享链接</button></view>